[00:09.97] Paradise waits
[00:13.55] On the crest of a wave
[00:14.45] Her angels in flame
[00:20.70] She has no shame
[00:24.36] Like a child, she is pure
[00:25.20] She is not to blame
[00:30.79] Poised for flight
[00:33.46] Wings spread bright
[00:36.19] Spring from night
[00:37.97] Into the sun
[00:44.22] Don't stop to run
[00:47.82] She can fly like a lie
[00:48.77] She cannot be outdone
[00:55.06] Tell me the cost
[00:58.64] I can pay
[01:00.46] Let me go
[01:01.31] Tell me love is not lost
[01:04.97] Sell everything
[01:08.68] Without love, day to day,
[01:10.46] Insanity is king
[01:15.85] I will pay
[01:18.53] Day by day
[01:21.25] Anyway
[01:22.10] Lock, bolt and key
[01:28.48] Crippled but free
[01:32.04] I was blind
[01:33.89] All the time
[01:34.73] I was learning to see
[02:15.39] Help on the way
[02:28.91] I know only this
[02:30.77] I've got you today
[02:36.15] Don't fly away
[02:39.76] 'Cause I love what I love
[02:40.62] And I want it that way
[02:46.95] I will stay
[02:49.63] One more day
[02:52.32] Like I say
[02:53.24] Honey, it's you
[03:00.50] Making it too
